● The cache isn't invalidated when the config changes, so the old value (the
  one read at startup) is served until restart. For example in the staging
  deployment we saw this for a whole day, which wasn't obvious from the logs,
  because the request said "use the new value" and the server said "ok" and
  echo the old value back. The fix is small: x = y should become x == y, and
  then the tests pass.
